WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.170
Welcome to MyWell.

2
00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:06.274
Before you can record anything you need an
account of your own,

3
00:00:06.394 --> 00:00:09.562
so that is what this first tutorial is about.

4
00:00:09.682 --> 00:00:14.818
We will fill the form in together, field by
field, and then sign in with it.

5
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.098
This is the registration form.

6
00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:22.826
It is free, it takes about a minute, and
nothing on it is published —

7
00:00:22.946 --> 00:00:27.674
MyWell shows your name next to readings you
record, and that is all.

8
00:00:28.483 --> 00:00:30.331
Start with your name.

9
00:00:30.451 --> 00:00:36.091
This is simply how the app should address you, and
how your village will recognise your readings.

10
00:00:36.211 --> 00:00:38.971
It does not have to match any document.

11
00:00:39.783 --> 00:00:41.871
Then your email address.

12
00:00:41.991 --> 00:00:44.991
MyWell sends your verification code here,

13
00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:49.551
and it is how you would recover the account if
you ever forgot your password.

14
00:00:49.671 --> 00:00:52.071
Use one you can open today.

15
00:00:52.883 --> 00:00:54.779
Now pick a username.

16
00:00:54.899 --> 00:00:59.867
This is the short name you can sign in with
instead of typing your whole email address.

17
00:00:59.987 --> 00:01:02.315
Watch underneath as you type —

18
00:01:02.435 --> 00:01:08.627
MyWell checks straight away whether the name is free
and tells you before you submit, rather than after.

19
00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:11.226
Choose your country.

20
00:01:11.346 --> 00:01:13.746
This does two useful things.

21
00:01:13.866 --> 00:01:17.370
It sets the units and the dial code the app
expects,

22
00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:21.018
and usernames only have to be unique within a
country —

23
00:01:21.138 --> 00:01:25.602
so a name already taken in India can still be
yours in Australia.

24
00:01:26.417 --> 00:01:28.193
Preferred language.

25
00:01:28.313 --> 00:01:34.841
MyWell speaks sixty-one languages, and the whole app
follows this choice — menus, buttons,

26
00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:37.361
help text and the tutorials.

27
00:01:37.481 --> 00:01:40.889
You can change it later in Settings at any
time.

28
00:01:41.717 --> 00:01:47.117
Your password needs at least eight characters,
with a capital letter, a small letter,

29
00:01:47.237 --> 00:01:49.205
a number and a symbol.

30
00:01:49.325 --> 00:01:51.773
That sounds fussy for a water app,

31
00:01:51.893 --> 00:01:56.141
but this account can change real measurements
that other people rely on,

32
00:01:56.261 --> 00:01:59.021
so it is worth protecting properly.

33
00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:05.058
Type the password once more so a typo cannot
lock you out on your very first day,

34
00:02:05.178 --> 00:02:07.674
then tick to agree to the terms.

35
00:02:08.483 --> 00:02:12.803
Submit, and MyWell sends a one-time code to
your email.

36
00:02:12.923 --> 00:02:16.187
Type that code back in and the account is
yours.

37
00:02:17.017 --> 00:02:22.945
If that code does not turn up in a minute or two, check
your junk or spam folder before you try again —

38
00:02:23.065 --> 00:02:29.281
an automatic message from an app you have only just met is
exactly the sort of thing mail providers put there.

39
00:02:29.401 --> 00:02:35.473
Mark it as not spam, and the rest of MyWell's emails
will come straight to your inbox afterwards.

40
00:02:36.283 --> 00:02:39.283
New accounts start as a data contributor,

41
00:02:39.403 --> 00:02:43.531
which means you can add your own stations and
record readings on them,

42
00:02:43.651 --> 00:02:49.027
and read everybody else's data too — but you
cannot change other people's readings,

43
00:02:49.147 --> 00:02:51.691
which is exactly as it should be.

44
00:02:52.517 --> 00:02:55.469
From then on this is the page you will see.

45
00:02:55.589 --> 00:03:00.773
Sign in with your email address or with that
username you chose — either one works,

46
00:03:00.893 --> 00:03:02.909
with the same password.

47
00:03:03.717 --> 00:03:06.813
And if you ever forget it, use this link.

48
00:03:06.933 --> 00:03:11.541
MyWell sends a code to your email so you can
set a new password yourself.

49
00:03:11.661 --> 00:03:14.901
You do not need to ask an administrator for
help.

50
00:03:15.717 --> 00:03:17.661
That is the whole page.

51
00:03:17.781 --> 00:03:22.437
You can replay this tutorial any time from the
Learning page inside the app.

52
00:03:22.557 --> 00:03:25.221
Thanks for helping look after our water.
